      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8099463261135127859, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The annual countryside cycling event took place yesterday under difficult
        conditions, with strong winds making the final portion of the route particularly
        demanding.

        More than fifty riders entered the competition, though
        only the strongest managed to maintain their speed during the steepest climbs.
        The leading group remained together for much of the race before separating
        during the final ascent.

        Victory eventually went to Thomas Reed,
        who launched a daring attack approximately one mile from the finish. His
        rivals attempted to respond but were unable to close the growing distance.

        Organizers
        declared the event a great success and confirmed that next year''s race will
        feature an extended route.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8551431192672133126, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Sprite
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6108b7d0feb9daa4a92cc11a62227b45, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8623385484294536488, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Officials have begun investigating several unusual pieces of racing
        equipment reportedly being used by competitors. The items, described by witnesses
        as \u201Cfar too advanced for ordinary running,\u201D are believed to provide
        athletes with a possible advantage.\nManufacturers have denied all accusations
        of wrongdoing and insist that their products merely represent the natural
        progress of sporting technology. The Racing Committee remains unconvinced."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8623385484294536488, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
      value: 3.4378662
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
