--- !u!1001 &378406911
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 103749566}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2659459170781084179, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'A major controversy has erupted following the unexpected participation
        of a woman in yesterday''s running competition.

        The athlete appeared
        at the starting line alongside the other competitors and reportedly insisted
        that she had every right to participate. Her presence immediately caused
        confusion among officials, several of whom argued that the event had traditionally
        been restricted to male runners.

        Despite the objections, the woman
        refused to leave the starting area. When the starting signal was eventually
        given, she entered the race and completed the course in impressive fashion.

        The
        crowd was sharply divided. Some spectators loudly demanded that she be removed
        from the competition, while others applauded her determination and performance.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2659459170781084179, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
      value: -0.2576294
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3198379244358998073, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -11.62
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: JournaleUI8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3561964259888679043, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -8.02
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4702836190640835036, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -19.48
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402518102195765066, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: A NEW GENERATION OF RUNNERS
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6059964909105023899, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: -7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6059964909105023899, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -8.96
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6109735740334789137, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The controversy became even greater when she finished ahead of several
        established competitors.

        Officials have temporarily withheld the
        final result while the Racing Committee examines the rules governing participation.
        Supporters of the runner argue that the regulations contain no clear statement
        preventing women from competing, while opponents insist that tradition should
        be respected.

        Whatever decision is eventually reached, yesterday''s
        race has already become one of the most controversial events in recent sporting
        history.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6828725365048007558, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: William Brooks once again proved himself the finest player on the local
        courts after defeating his challenger in a lengthy afternoon contest. The
        champion remained calm under pressure and secured victory with a series of
        powerful serves.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7011553334276646393, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -15.38
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7025677484130992791, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -21.98
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7673294450624766279, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: An investigation into a recent racing controversy has failed to uncover
        sufficient evidence of wrongdoing. The athlete involved has been cleared
        to compete again
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7966663401823183650, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
