--- !u!1001 &1635684113
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 103749566}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 313948706270051055, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: NEW REGULATOR APPOINTED
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2659459170781084179, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The Racing Committee has finally taken action against what it describes
        as a \u201Cserious and growing threat to the integrity of competitive racing.\u201D
        Following months of complaints from athletes and spectators, an agreement
        was reached yesterday to create an entirely new official position: The Racing
        Regulator.\nThe regulator will be responsible for inspecting competitors,
        observing races, investigating suspicious performances, and ensuring that
        every runner follows the officially marked course. Until now, these duties
        had been divided between several officials, a system which critics claim
        allowed dishonest competitors to escape unnoticed.\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: JournaleUI1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3903668237661538120, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SizeDelta.x
      value: 12.1062
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3903668237661538120, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SizeDelta.y
      value: 9.0293
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3903668237661538120, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: -0.0001
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3903668237661538120, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: 0.0147
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402518102195765066, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: COURT CHAMPION RETAINS HIS TITLE
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6109735740334789137, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The decision follows a series of increasingly unusual incidents. Several
        runners have been accused of taking shortcuts, receiving unauthorized assistance,
        and using questionable substances before important competitions.\nThe Committee
        insists that the new position is not intended to frighten honest athletes.
        \u201CThose who run fairly have nothing to fear,\u201D declared one official.
        \u201COur only concern is protecting the reputation of the sport.\u201D\nThe
        identity of the first regulator has not yet been revealed, although rumors
        suggest that the individual has extensive experience studying suspicious
        racing performances."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6109735740334789137, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
      value: 0.8066406
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6828725365048007558, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The growing number of cheating scandals has created an unexpected market
        for those willing to sell athletes an unfair advantage. Secret suppliers
        are reportedly offering everything from suspicious medicines to unauthorized
        racing equipment.

        Authorities have begun monitoring several vendors
        believed to be involved. Despite their efforts, demand for these products
        appears to be growing among desperate competitors.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8021706265186088782, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Pivot.x
      value: 0.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8021706265186088782, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Pivot.y
      value: 0.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8021706265186088782, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.x
      value: 0.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8021706265186088782, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.y
      value: 0.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8021706265186088782, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMin.x
      value: 0.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8021706265186088782, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
